abstract: >
  A multi-agent intrusion detection system combining rule-based logic,
  Isolation Forest machine learning, and LLM-based alert enrichment,
  applied to risk-based authentication threat detection. Developed as a
  final-year BSc Information Technology research project at the University of
  Ghana.
